===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To offer [[illicit]] sex with a third party; to [[pimp]].
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[tempt]] with, to [[appeal]] or [[cater]] to [[improper]] [[motivations]], etc.; to assist in gratification.
#: ''His latest speech '''panders''' to the worst instincts of the electorate.''
# {{lb|en|transitive|obsolete}} To act as a pander for (somebody).

